{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/168","id":4762057366,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTEdTLM8AAAABG9c6lg","html_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pull/168","diff_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pull/168.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pull/168.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/issues/168","number":168,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Prove global subgradients at relative-interior points","user":{"login":"jicheng9617","id":74550583,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NTUwNTgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74550583?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617","html_url":"https://github.com/jicheng9617","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Ambient-interior existence cannot be instantiated on lower-dimensional domains with empty ambient interior. This package proves the mandatory stronger relative-interior footnote in Orabona arXiv:1912.13213v10, printed17/PDF29, using the original domain and the same shared Lean library.\n\nTwo genuine new public proofs preserve affine contact at every specified relative-interior point and then construct a global subgradient by Riesz representation. The first restricts to the direction space of the domain affine span, reuses the accepted ambient-contact theorem, extends the linear functional and corrects the intercept while recovering equality at the original point. A pure affine minorant would lose the needed contact. The source-facing vector theorem retains proper convexity in a finite-dimensional real inner-product space; the intermediate works in a finite-dimensional real normed space, where no-bottom and relative membership imply a finite witness. Completeness derives from finite dimensionality. No closedness, differentiability, full-dimensionality or support oracle is added. Supports quantify over all ambient points.\n\nThe existing ambient producer and old interval canary remain unchanged. New public canaries invoke the new contact theorem on a nonconstant nonclosed plane-ray loss, invoke the new vector producer on a proper real singleton indicator, and prove that singleton domain has empty ambient interior. Source mapping retains old links in the single shared registry; the shared ambient-contact dependency keeps its original Minorant ownership.\n\nValidation:\n\n- Distinct automated CONTRACT/BODY/FINAL source reviews accepted with explicit deltas; all nine reader requirements rechecked. Requested Astra/medium, with no human/external/runtime-model attestation claim.\n- Focused3307jobs, public bodies/canaries, eight named kernel checks using standard Lean foundations, three separate native guards, sequential combined root9089/Tests9233 and complete harness466tests/seven existing skips passed. Cached jobs are included.\n- Actual selected compiled graph8proofnodes/1193directreferences verifies the producer/canary calls; it is not a full registry export. Clean applicable lean-verified local site at `ff64ffa000da47ecdd52eae776ce5db647b8092c` preserves all10809oldIDsURLs and adds exactly2canonical mathematical proof nodes (10811total). Site checks and actual first browser viewport passed.\n- Exact stacked contributor/history/task-only shadow/scoped whitespace gates passed. Preserved failures: untracked new canary packaging readiness, manifest Windows-path spelling, and a verifier expectation confusing reader links with formal module ownership. Repairs changed Git tracking or evidence metadata, never theorem bodies/statements or test rules. Default raw CRLF/evidence whitespace diagnostics remain alongside scoped checks and run-local raw-byte preservation.\n\nStacked on OPEN draft#167 exactb7b72d2c587128ddb639b2fd40c27016f20555bc (`codex/research-online-subgradient-basic-migration`), unmerged into main. One retained source producer plus two new proofs cover two unnumbered source branches, zero numbered anchors; the affine helper is a necessary intermediate, not a separately printed theorem. Only OnlineSubgradientInterior migration is accepted (legacy8→7 after this PR delivery). Theorems2.22/2.23 and remaining Chapter1/2 main-text/appendix/source-contract work remain mandatory; main-relative diagnostics retain nine Chapter1 gaps. Chapter2 mandatory total remains null/incomplete and the Chapters1–16 Goal stays active. No merge, deployment, main/live update or worktree retirement.\n\nEvidence: `runs/online-subgradient-interior-migration-20261006/accepted-decision-v1.json`, `accepted-binding-audit-v1.json`, `integrated-gates-overlay-v1.json`, `final-reader-receipt-v1.json`; frozen targets under `docs/contracts/online-subgradient-interior-migration-v1`.\n","created_at":"2026-10-06T17:01:44Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T17:01:44Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/168/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/168/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandi